sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Planner
    participant E as Executor
    participant H as Harness / Session
    participant D as Device tools
    Note over P,D: Rolling refinement: keep global requirements and a tentative roadmap; concretize only the current stage and choose actions from observations.
    P->>H: Save one current_stage and optional assumption_roadmap
    H->>E: Stage, skills, memory, observation and tentative roadmap
    Note over E,D: The roadmap explains dependencies, not future-action permission. Executor may change local routes while the stage goal remains valid.
    E->>H: Submit act with current observation ID
    H->>D: Dispatch after validation
    D-->>H: Return receipt and post-observation
    H->>H: Commit step, state and consumption
    H-->>E: Provide feedback; continue stage
    alt Stage complete with remaining work: rolling refinement
    E->>H: advance with completed stage_id
    H->>P: Actual results, current observation and cross-stage notes
    P->>H: Check future assumptions; refine next stage; revision +1
    H->>E: Supply new stage; retain useful history and consumption
    else Invalid premise or stage scope: online replanning
    E->>H: replan with concrete mismatch and evidence
    H->>P: Invalid premise and still-valid progress
    P->>H: Revise affected stage, order or roadmap assumptions
    H->>E: Supply revised stage; continue the existing task
    else Task completion requested
    E->>H: finish; request task verdict
    H->>P: Request task-level judgment
    P->>H: complete or request review
    end
